5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hello everyone! I'm so excited to play this with you all! Let's work together and find the werewolf so we can save the village! Who should we talk to first?,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. Since we have no information yet, I believe the most rational approach is to observe everyone's behavior and speech patterns before making any assumptions.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with Victoria. On this first day, we have no concrete evidence. It is best to remain calm and observe how everyone interacts before we draw any conclusions.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,George,,I agree with the general sentiment. Let us take our time and observe. There is no need to rush into accusations when we have so little to go on.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited! I'm going to be the best detective ever and find the werewolf! Let's have lots of fun, everyone!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, you're so energetic! I love it! Maybe we can be detective partners? Does anyone have a plan for how we should vote tomorrow, or should we just wait for the Seer?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Waiting for the Seer's guidance is the most logical path. However, we should also pay attention to who is overly eager to lead the conversation or who seems unusually hesitant. Observation is our only tool today.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, your point about hesitation is valid. I will be paying close attention to the gaps in our conversation. For now, I believe we should simply let the dialogue flow naturally.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,George,,I believe that is the wisest course of action. Let us simply speak and listen. I shall be observing from the sidelines to see if any inconsistencies emerge in our stories.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Detective partners! Yes, please, Kenji! I'll find all the clues! I'm going to watch everyone's faces really, really closely to see if anyone is acting super suspicious! Hehe!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'll be watching too! I'm not as smart as Victoria or Toshio, but I'll do my best to help! Does anyone else want to share how they're feeling about the game so far?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"I am feeling quite composed. While the atmosphere is light, I am mindful that the werewolf is among us, likely observing our reactions just as I am observing yours. I remain focused on the task.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"I am similarly composed. While the energy in this group is varied, I am simply analyzing the patterns. I believe it is important to maintain this level of objectivity to avoid being misled by emotion.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,George,,"I find myself in agreement. While the enthusiasm of the younger members is refreshing, a steady hand and a clear mind are what will ultimately protect this village. I shall remain patient.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm not just energetic, I'm a super-sleuth! I can tell when people are hiding secrets! I'm going to find the werewolf and be the hero of the village! This is so exciting!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,I hope we can all be heroes together! I'm really glad we're all getting along so well. I'll keep my eyes open for any clues!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
