22,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I believe we have established a sufficient baseline for today. I shall spend the remaining time reflecting on our interactions.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I have observed enough for the first day. I will now focus on synthesizing these initial impressions to see if any contradictions arise tomorrow.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,George,,I believe we have done all we can for today. I shall retire and reflect on these conversations in my own time. I look forward to seeing what tomorrow brings.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Me too! I'm going to dream about all the clues I'll find tomorrow! Goodnight everyone, see you in the morning!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
