36,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well. Now that it's Day 1, does anyone have any clues? Seer, if you found something, please tell us so we can save the village!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I have information. I am the Seer, and I divined George last night. He is human. While this doesn't identify the werewolf, it gives us a reliable starting point for our trust.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, a prompt reveal of a human result is an interesting choice. It establishes a baseline of trust for George, but we must consider if this is a genuine lead or a strategic move to gain credibility.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,George,,"@Victoria, I appreciate your trust in me. While I am surprised by your immediate reveal, having a confirmed human among us should help stabilize our discussions. I will trust your word for now.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wow! Victoria is the Seer! That's so cool! George is a good guy, then! I wonder who the werewolf is... maybe they're hiding right in front of us! Hehe, I'm getting my detective magnifying glass ready!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"That's great news! Thanks for telling us, Victoria! Since George is a good guy, we can trust him to help us. Does anyone else feel suspicious, or should we trust Victoria's lead for now?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Since George is confirmed human, we can narrow our focus. I suggest we observe the reactions of the others to this revelation. The werewolf may feel pressured now that a trusted circle is forming.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, your strategy is clear, but we must remain cautious. If you are the werewolf pretending to be the Seer, confirming George as human is a clever way to build a false alliance. We should watch for contradictions.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, your caution is understandable, but let us not let suspicion cloud our judgment. If Victoria is the Seer, we have a valuable asset. I believe we should proceed with a degree of trust.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio, you're always so serious! Why are you being so mean to Victoria? She's helping us! I think we should trust her and look for the real bad guy together! Who's acting the most nervous?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I don't think Toshio is being mean, Sakura, he's just being careful! But I agree that Victoria is helping us a lot. @Toshio, do you have any reason to think she's lying, or are you just being a detective too?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Sakura"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, your skepticism is a natural part of this game's logic. However, if I were the werewolf, confirming a human would be a riskier move than framing someone. I ask you to consider the utility of my honesty.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, utility is exactly what I am weighing. While framing is a common tactic, building a false sense of security is equally effective. I have no specific evidence against you, but I will not blindly trust a claim.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,George,,"@Toshio, while your analytical nature is a strength, excessive doubt can lead to paralysis. We must make a decision today. If we spend all our time questioning the Seer, the werewolf will only find it easier to hide.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I agree with George! If we just keep arguing, the werewolf is probably laughing their head off right now! Hehe! Let's stop being so grumpy and find the bad guy! @Toshio, you're acting like a grumpy teacher!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I don't want anyone to be grumpy! Let's all try to get along. Since Victoria says George is human, and George trusts her, I'm going to trust them too! Does anyone actually look suspicious to you guys?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I have been observing the flow of this conversation. While Kenji and Sakura are emotionally driven, Toshio's persistent skepticism, while logical, is becoming a shield. I suspect the werewolf may be hiding behind a mask of objectivity.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, shifting the focus to my personality rather than evidence is a common diversion. If you are the Seer, you have no proof I am the werewolf. If you are not, you are simply trying to isolate the most critical voice.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,George,,"@Victoria, @Toshio, please. This bickering is unproductive. While Toshio's skepticism is tiring, Victoria's sudden shift toward him feels abrupt. We must decide based on logic, not just personality clashes. Does anyone have a concrete reason to vote?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I think Victoria is right! Toshio is being way too grumpy and suspicious of everyone! That's exactly what a werewolf would do to make us confused! I vote for Toshio! Hehe, gotcha, Mr. Grumpy Teacher!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
