69,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Oh no! Victoria was attacked! That's terrible! She was trying so hard to help us, and now she's gone. Does this mean she really was the Seer? If the werewolf attacked her, they must have been scared of her!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,George,,It is a tragedy. The fact that Victoria was targeted so quickly strongly suggests she was indeed the Seer. The werewolf clearly viewed her as the greatest threat to their survival. We must now be even more vigilant.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Poor Victoria! This is so sad! I can't believe the mean werewolf did that! Now we have to work even harder to find them, or they'll get us all! Who do you think did it, George?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"I agree with George! Since the werewolf attacked Victoria, she must have been the real Seer. That means George is definitely human too! Now it's just us three. @Sakura, @George, who do you think is the werewolf?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Victoria"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,George,,"It is a difficult position to be in. With Victoria gone, we have lost our most reliable source of information. We must look closely at Kenji and Sakura. One of you is the werewolf, and the other is likely a villager.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Kenji"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"What?! George, how could you say that?! I'm just a little girl! I've been trying so hard to be a super-sleuth and help everyone! I can't believe you're suspecting me! @Kenji, tell him I'm a good girl!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@George, that's a bit scary! I'm sure Sakura is a good girl, she's been so helpful and excited! But I guess we have to be careful. If Victoria was the Seer, then the werewolf is definitely one of us three. I'm a villager, I promise!","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""George"",""Sakura"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,George,,"@Kenji, promises are easy to make in this game. While I have no reason to doubt your sincerity, we must remain objective. Sakura's emotional reaction is expected, but we cannot let it distract us from the logic of the situation.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm not just being emotional, I'm sad because you're being mean! I've been your friend this whole time! @George, you're acting just like Mr. Grumpy Teacher now! Why are you trying to pick on me and Kenji?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I don't want us to fight! But George is right that we have to be careful. If we don't find the werewolf today, they might win! @George, if you're human, do you have any clues about who is acting suspicious?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,George,,"I have no concrete evidence, but we must consider the patterns. Sakura's energy is a mask, and Kenji's eagerness to please can be a shield. I suspect the werewolf is playing on our emotions to avoid scrutiny.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"That's so unfair! I'm not wearing a mask, I'm just me! You're just guessing because you don't have any real clues! @Kenji, George is being a big meanie again! I'm a villager, I promise! I'll cry if you vote for me!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
